        "notes": "Q1: only TASK items propagate, one way: a TASK item marked done sets the task to Done (with completedAt); un-ticking never changes the source; HABIT and LEARNING_RESOURCE items never change their source. Q2: status computed on read: NOT_STARTED while now < start; COMPLETED once now >= end, or now >= start and all items done; otherwise IN_PROGRESS (un-ticking before the end moves it back to IN_PROGRESS). Q3: Settings = displayName (optional, <= 100 chars, used in the Dashboard greeting via GET /api/settings), planStartNotifications (on/off, default on; the frontend shows plan-start notifications only when on), defaultPage (one of the six pages, default Dashboard); stored on the server; time zone shown read-only from GET /api/app-info. Q4 (tooling, looked up on Maven Central via ./mvnw dependency:get ...:RELEASE on 2026-09-24 in the dry run and built with Java 25): org.jacoco:jacoco-maven-plugin 0.8.15, org.springdoc:springdoc-openapi-maven-plugin 1.5."
